# WiFi routing overlay: exact/namespace rules only; broad GeoIP fallbacks moved to legacy_geoip.
# The original Real-IP fallback comment below is retained for source-line audit; its rules are in the legacy file.
# Italy
# Source: https://mcc-mnc-lookup.com/country/it/
# Coverage mode: all observed carrier rows grouped by MCC/MNC
# 3GPP domain pattern: ims.mnc<MNC>.mcc<MCC>.3gppnetwork.org
# 3GPP pub domain pattern: epdg.epc.mnc<MNC>.mcc<MCC>.pub.3gppnetwork.org

# Real-IP fallback for IKEv2/IPsec Wi-Fi Calling (UDP has no SNI/Host)

